# Security Rules

- Never commit secrets.
- Use environment variables or user secrets for local config.
- Treat prompts, tool arguments, uploaded files, and model responses as untrusted input.
- Validate all external input.
- Avoid exposing internal exception details to the frontend.
- Require explicit user approval before destructive tool actions.
